          "relation": "supporting",
          "snippet": {
            "line": 196,
            "text": "theorem stocks_comparison (k : ℕ) (h X₀ X₁ μ B B₀ : ℝ)\n    (hh : 0 < h) (hh' : h < 1/2) (hX₀ : 0 < X₀) (hXX : X₀ ≤ X₁)\n    (hμ : 0 < μ) (hB : 0 ≤ B) (hB₀ : 0 ≤ B₀) :\n    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ X ∈ Icc X₀ X₁, ∀ P₀ : ℝ → ℝ,\n      ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ P₀ J → Bound (k+1) P₀ B₀ →\n      ∀ f g : Curves, ∀ ε : ℝ, 0 ≤ ε →\n      (∀ i, PairBound (k+1) (f i) (g i) B 1 ε) →\n      (∀ η ∈ J, μ ≤ f 0 η) → (∀ η ∈ J, μ ≤ g 0 η) →\n      ∀ i, Bound k (fun η => stocks h X P₀ g i η - stocks h X P₀ f i η) (C*ε)"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
